  m_Name: SSO_Log_Raj_Second
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Header: Mind-Bending Discoveries !
  Body: "I\u2019m probably not even a tenth of a way down, and I already feel that
    the elders would go CRAZY if I were able to tell them about the things I\u2019ve
    read in here.\r\n\r\nFirst of all, the gods have an actual title: the Architects!
    They seem to have gifted those who built the Tower with divine tools. Does this
    also mean there are others like us living below the Tower? There\u2019s still
    a lot I don\u2019t understand, but my mind can\u2019t help but make theories\u2026\r\n\r\nRajanii"
  IsDiscovered: 0
